                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "T.I. Oil & Gas concentrates Titanium Industries’ key resources and capabilities for the global oil & gas marketplace. By providing specialty metals in titanium and super alloys, T.I. is able to deliver high strength, corrosion resistant materials necessary for the most challenging oil & gas applications and environments such as exploration, production and refining."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Achieving a wide range of OEM and subcontractor approvals, Titanium Industries has a strong portfolio of service provider LTA’s, and is ISO 9001:2015 registered. Providing a global service center inventory at competitive prices, guaranteed quality and 24/7 delivery to all levels of the oil & gas supply chain, T.I. Oil & Gas is poised to deliver. Our strategically placed global locations allow us to service this market from a local source, using the local language."
                },
